    "title": "Altoona Man Arrested For Felony Charges In Ringgold County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago The Ringgold County Sheriff’s Department reports two Creston residents have been arrested for drug related offenses. 25-year-old Giaci Schoenfeld was arrested July 2nd for the simple misdemeanor for possession of drug paraphernalia. 21-year-old Echo Marie Bolinger was also arrested for the same charge. The bond was set at $300 for both. Read full article\n2",
